1
00:00:00,405 --> 00:00:03,495
(Sheldon:)For an evening of passing a bottle
of fortified wine around a trash can...

2
00:00:03,658 --> 00:00:05,368
(Sheldon:)...you look great.

3
00:00:21,843 --> 00:00:23,593
(Sheldon:)What am I thinking? Whiskers.

4
00:00:27,724 --> 00:00:30,434
(Penny:)Oh, hey, if we hurry we can make
the Jennifer Aniston movie.

5
00:00:30,601 --> 00:00:31,681
(Leonard:)Oh, yeah, sure.

6
00:00:31,853 --> 00:00:33,773
Yeah, uh,
there's also an amazing documentary...

7
00:00:33,938 --> 00:00:37,108
...about building a dam on a river
in South America.

8
00:00:38,484 --> 00:00:41,274
(Penny:)Okay, but the Jennifer Aniston movie
has Jennifer Aniston.

9
00:00:41,446 --> 00:00:43,946
(Penny:)And she's not building a dam.

10
00:00:44,991 --> 00:00:48,491
- Can't argue with that. I'll get the tickets.
- Okay.

11
00:00:49,495 --> 00:00:52,495
(Leonard:)Actually, you know what?

12
00:00:52,665 --> 00:00:55,165
(Leonard:)I think it's about time
I pick a movie we see.

13
00:00:55,376 --> 00:00:57,506
Wha?... You picked plenty of movies.

14
00:00:57,670 --> 00:01:01,340
(Leonard:)No, you always picked
and it was always the same.

